\f0\fs24 \cf0 The R files generate the E-LASSO forecast developed in\
\
\'93Cross-Sectional Expected Returns: New Fama-MacBeth Regressions in the Era of Machine Learning\'94 by Yufeng Han, Ai He, Dave Rapach, and Guofu Zhou.\
\
Run the file programMainElasso.R, which is extensively annotated.\
\
The file programMainElasso.R calls the following files in each of the 3 steps for computing the E-LASSO forecast:\
\
Step 1 - S-LASSO forecast\
\
programCoefLasso.R\
programForecastSlasso.R\
\
Step 2 - C-LASSO forecast\
\
programCoefUni.R\
programForecastUni.R\
programForecastClasso.R\
\
Step 3 - E-LASSO forecast\
\
programForecastElasso.R\
\
The file programEvaluateForecast.R evaluates forecasts using the methods developed in the paper.\
\
To replicate the results for the application in the paper, load the data file dataFillCsm1960_2021.RDS available at\
\
https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DkoVQT1Pq4uzbeNWfYxItfYKbtW4r-1P/view.\
\
The code is provided gratis with no guarantees.\
\
If you have questions about the code, please contact Dave Rapach at dave.rapach@gmail.com.\
